      "detector_heading": "🚩 If you are accused and you did not do it",
      "detector_not_a_loophole": "Read this the right way round: detectors being unreliable is not a reason to think you can get away with it. It is a reason to keep your drafts, and a reason to speak up if a number is used against you or someone in your class.",
