      "water_foragers_collect_droplets_and_sp": "Water foragers collect droplets and spread them on comb surfaces. Fanner bees create airflow (230 wingbeats/sec) that evaporates the water, cooling by ~10°C. If overheating continues, bees \"beard\" outside the entrance to reduce internal body heat.",
