      "workers_are_showing_signs_of_nosema_so": "Workers are showing signs of Nosema — soiled comb, reduced longevity, and sluggish foraging. This single-cell gut parasite weakens bees from the inside.",
      "workers_cap_the_cell_with_wax_inside_e": "Workers cap the cell with wax. Inside: eyes, wings, legs, organs all form",
      "workforce_by_role": "👷 Workforce by role",
