      "reflection_vs_absorption": "Reflection vs Absorption",
      "research_shows_that_anyone_can_learn_b": "Research shows that anyone can learn basic echolocation with practice. The key is producing consistent clicks and learning to interpret the subtle differences in echo timing, loudness, and frequency that indicate object size, distance, and material.",
      "reset": "↺ Reset",
