      "pick_the_bird_you_find_most_attractive": "Pick the bird you find most attractive. The chosen mate reproduces — others don't. Over rounds, the population's \"showiness\" escalates because YOU keep picking the showiest. Watch peacock-style runaway sexual selection unfold under your own preferences. Toggle a predator cost to see how it stabilizes.",
      "pick_the_directional_peppered_moth_pre": "Pick the directional (peppered moth) preset, set Selection Strength to 1.0, click Step 10. Watch the mean shift toward 0.85. Now set Selection to 0 and step another 30 generations — the mean wanders randomly without converging.",
