      "the_point": "The point: ",
      "the_red_line_on_the_trait_chart_approa": "The red line on the trait chart approaches the green dashed \"camouflage ideal\" line. That's natural selection in action — the population converging on the trait you're NOT selecting against.",
      "the_red_queen_runs_faster_every_year": "The Red Queen runs faster every year",
