      "the_two_types": "The two types",
      "these_are_homologous_structures_same_o": "These are HOMOLOGOUS structures (same origin, different function). A bird wing and a butterfly wing are ANALOGOUS (same function, totally different origins) — the butterfly wing has no humerus or phalanges. Homology is the key signature of common descent.",
