      "includes_folate_b9_supports_dna_synthe": "Includes folate (B9) — supports DNA synthesis and red blood cell formation.",
      "includes_iron_supports_hemoglobin_oxyg": "Includes iron — supports hemoglobin (oxygen transport in blood) and steady energy. Especially important for menstruating teens.",
      "includes_magnesium_most_us_adults_unde": "Includes magnesium — most US adults under-consume; supports muscle / nerve function and energy production.",
