      "charlotte_guillard_biography_biblioth_": "Charlotte Guillard biography — Bibliothèque nationale de France",
      "charlotte_guillard_outlived_two_husban": "Charlotte Guillard outlived two husbands (both printers) and ran her shop for 40 years.",
