      "a_0_08_bac_legal_limit_for_adults_adds": "This simulator adds ~280 ms as a teaching model for impaired reaction. NHTSA lists reaction-time impairment at .08 BAC; at 55 mph, even a few tenths of a second can add car lengths before braking starts.",
      "a_130_lb_teenager_drops_below_maine_s_": "One 12-oz beer can leave a teen above Maine's under-21 0.00 standard for hours. Food, fatigue, and body composition shift the curve — you can't reliably \"feel\" your BAC.",
